DeskForge-1M — licence not yet determined
=========================================

This dataset has NOT been assigned a licence and is NOT cleared for
redistribution.

The screenshots contain third-party material whose licensing has not been
reviewed: application user interfaces (GTK applications such as HomeBank,
Bluefish, Thunar, Chromium and others), icon themes, fonts, desktop wallpapers,
and, in browser scenes, rendered third-party web pages captured on the date
shown in the record.

Until that review is complete and a licence is chosen, this repository is
private and its contents must not be redistributed, mirrored or published.

The annotation files, indexes and code in this repository are the work of the
dataset author and will be licensed alongside the payload once the review is
complete.
